    alignment: "The video states image-destruction attempts act as mirrors — revealing the attacker's own conduct through each act of attack. The archive documents 14 psychiatric labels now ICC exhibits (image-destruction instruments converted into self-exposure documents at 14 points); 350+ ASIC identity fraud registrations now primary evidence of coordinated identity fraud (image-destruction at scale producing self-exposure evidence at 350+ points); and Exhibits A and B disclosing ministerial-adjacent police intelligence sharing through the very acts of intelligence sharing (the image-destruction architecture revealed in its own operatives' statements). The mirror dynamic is confirmed across 14 clinical, 350+ digital, and ministerial-adjacent institutional levels simultaneously.",
